---
import StudioFrame from '../../components/StudioFrame.astro';
---

<StudioFrame title="相册家谱总览" wide>
  <section class="studio-card studio-preview" data-studio-preview>
    <div class="studio-preview-toolbar">
      <div><span class="eyebrow" data-preview-kicker>PHOTO GENEALOGY / 相册家谱总览</span></div>
      <div class="studio-preview-toolbar-actions"><span class="studio-preview-member-note" data-preview-member-note>按印刷页检查文字、图片与顺序</span><button class="text-link" type="button" data-preview-print hidden>下载 PDF</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="studio-preview-readiness" data-preview-readiness aria-live="polite"></div>
    <div class="studio-preview-book" data-preview-book>
      <p class="studio-empty">正在整理你的家谱预览…</p>
    </div>
    <p class="studio-note" data-preview-privacy-note>这份总览只对当前会员登录有效；图片会按印刷比例呈现，方便检查图文是否贴合。</p>
    <div class="studio-preview-footer-nav"><a class="studio-back-link" data-preview-return href="/studio">← 返回我的相册家谱</a></div>
    <p class="studio-status" aria-live="polite" data-studio-status></p>
  </section>
</StudioFrame>
<script>
  import '../../scripts/studio-preview';
</script>
